# Purpose

This document defines the API engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish consistent service boundaries, stable contracts, and predictable communication between platform components while supporting long-term scalability and maintainability.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* API philosophy
* API architecture
* Service boundaries
* Contract design
* API consistency
* API governance

It intentionally excludes transport protocols, framework-specific implementation, serialization formats, and endpoint implementation details, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to application programming interfaces, ensuring service communication remains reliable, consistent, and aligned with the platform architecture.

